          <path d="M7.75 2C4.57 2 2 4.57 2 7.75v8.5C2 19.43 4.57 22 7.75 22h8.5C19.43 22 22 19.43 22 16.25v-8.5C22 4.57 19.43 2 16.25 2h-8.5zm0 2h8.5C18.01 4 20 5.99 20 7.75v8.5c0 1.76-1.99 3.75-3.75 3.75h-8.5C5.99 20 4 18.01 4 16.25v-8.5C4 5.99 5.99 4 7.75 4zm8.75 2a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2zM12 7a5 5 0 100 10 5 5 0 000-10zm0 2a3 3 0 110 6 3 3 0 010-6z"/>
